s to translation for litigation purposes or any other necessary documents to ensure you get and maintain exclusive patent rights!\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b5a74f1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b5a74f1\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1d5592d\" data-id=\"1d5592d\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f16d7dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f16d7dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"475\" height=\"564\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/istock_000001118967-e1663591106517.jpg\" class=\"attachment-1536x1536 size-1536x1536 wp-image-1909\" alt=\"Hand writing\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/istock_000001118967-e1663591106517.jpg 475w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/istock_000001118967-e1663591106517-253x300.jpg 253w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f3d44f0\" data-id=\"f3d44f0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\